からちょっと気になっただけだ。","nextNodeIds":[110400505]},{"nodeId":110400505,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1019,"speakerName":"スクロース","textMapHash":3246285538,"text":"なるほど。彼ならアルベド先生に呼ばれたよ。代わりに私がここにいるの。","nextNodeIds":[110400506]},{"nodeId":110400506,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1019,"speakerName":"スクロース","textMapHash":2213912602,"text":"協力が必要なら私を呼んで。いらないなら…私、そこで本読んでるから、うん。","nextNodeIds":[110400507]},{"nodeId":110400507,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3022876666,"text":"ありがとうな。オイラたち使い方は慣れてるから心配ないぞ、そうだよな？","nextNodeIds":[110400508]},{"nodeId":110400508,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":478376970,"text":"うん、邪魔しないよ。","nextNodeIds":[110400509]},{"nodeId":110400509,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1019,"speakerName":"スクロース","textMapHash":964545562,"text":"さすがは、あの風魔龍を倒した人だね…","nextNodeIds":[110400510]},{"nodeId":110400510,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1019,"speakerName":"スクロース","textMapHash":972769730,"text":"そ、そうだ。あなたなら、きっとアルベド先生の役に立てるかも。","nextNodeIds":[110400511]},{"nodeId":110400511,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1120768898,"text":"そういえば、前もおまえとティマイオスから「アルベド先生」って人の話を聞いたけど、そいつもモンド城の錬金術師なのか？","nextNodeIds":[110400225,110400226]},{"nodeId":110400225,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1496180810,"text":"知らない名前だ。","nextNodeIds":[110400227]},{"nodeId":110400227,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1019,"speakerName":"スクロース","textMapHash":94193906,"text":"紹介が遅れてごめん、アルベド先生は西風騎士団の首席錬金術師、私とティマイオスの先生でもあるの。","nextNodeIds":[110400228]},{"nodeId":110400228,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3058007938,"text":"普段はティマイオスが錬金術を教えてるとこしか見かけないけど、そのアルベドは先生の先生ってことだな？","nextNodeIds":[110400229]},{"nodeId":110400229,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1019,"speakerName":"スクロース","textMapHash":3364521554,"text":"はい。先生は世界の真相の探究に力を入れてて、成果もたくさん出してるの。","nextNodeIds":[110400230]},{"nodeId":110400230,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1019,"speakerName":"スクロース","textMapHash":3989116978,"text":"先生の助けを求めるためにわざわざモンドに来る錬金術師もよく見かけるよ。どんな難題でも先生に聞いたらすぐ解決するの。","nextNodeIds":[110400231]},{"nodeId":110400231,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4031851170,"text":"わぁ、すごい人なんだな！","nextNodeIds":[110400232]},{"nodeId":110400232,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1019,"speakerName":"スクロース","textMapHash":2899484666,"text":"うん。でも最近先生の研究がうまく行ってないみたいで、会う時はいつも元気がないの。","nextNodeIds":[110400233,110400234]},{"nodeId":110400233,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2039162506,"text":"そんなすごい人の力になれるかな。","nextNodeIds":[110400235]},{"nodeId":110400235,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1019,"speakerName":"スクロース","textMapHash":3082801154,"text":"あなたが体験した冒険はきっと先生も興味があるはずだから、インスピレーションのきっかけになるんじゃないかな。","nextNodeIds":[110400236]},{"nodeId":110400236,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1019,"speakerName":"スクロース","textMapHash":1924227722,"text":"先生は礼儀をわきまえた人だし、彼を助けたらきっと相応のお返しをもらえるはず。","nextNodeIds":[110400237,110400239]},{"nodeId":110400237,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2712808282,"text":"もっと強くなれる？","nextNodeIds":[110400238]},{"nodeId":110400238,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1019,"speakerName":"スクロース","textMapHash":929119042,"text":"できるかもね。生命の極致を探求するのも先生の研究課題のひとつだから。","nextNodeIds":[110400241]},{"nodeId":110400241,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1019,"speakerName":"スクロース","textMapHash":2767617906,"text":"アルベド先生は今ティマイオスと一緒に雪山にいるはず。案内したいけど、錬金場から離れるわけにはいかないから。","nextNodeIds":[110400242]},{"nodeId":110400242,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1019,"speakerName":"スクロース","textMapHash":3919810658,"text":"雪山の入口で探してみて。先生は穏やかな若い方で、学者のオーラがあって、それから…","nextNodeIds":[110400243]},{"nodeId":110400243,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1019,"speakerName":"スクロース","textMapHash":1754884146,"text":"…ごめん、どう説明すればいいか分からない。とにかく探してみてちょうだい。","nextNodeIds":[110400244]},{"nodeId":110400244,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":973415650,"text":"おう、分かったぞ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":110400239,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3334931594,"text":"パイモンをもっと強くできる？","nextNodeIds":[110400240]},{"nodeId":110400240,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3499819354,"text":"それに需要を感じないぞ。お返しは、へへっ、やっぱモラがいいな。","nextNodeIds":[110400241]},{"nodeId":110400234,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3628627970,"text":"#{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_BOYFIRST|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_GIRLFIRST]}の錬金術に関する知識は錬金台しか…","nextNodeIds":[110400235]},{"nodeId":110400226,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1083817298,"text":"どこかで聞いたことあるような。","nextNodeIds":[110400227]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1104002,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1104005,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_START","LNHLPKELCAL":["1019"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":1104003,"order":3,"stepDescription":"ドラゴンスパインの入口に行く","stepDescTextMapHash":582235108,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1104003,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYL