"そういうのには参加しないって言ったよね、もっと大事なことがあるの。","nextNodeIds":[110400403]},{"nodeId":110400403,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1008,"speakerName":"バーバラ","textMapHash":2830649594,"text":"でも、今回は記念的な行事だし、シスターのみんなには出席してほしくて。","nextNodeIds":[110400404]},{"nodeId":110400404,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"ロサリア","textMapHash":3976695834,"text":"それは君の考えだし、「他人の願いを叶える」ことは私の仕事じゃないわ。","nextNodeIds":[110400405]},{"nodeId":110400405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1008,"speakerName":"バーバラ","textMapHash":187417026,"text":"そ、それは…","nextNodeIds":[110400406]},{"nodeId":110400406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"ロサリア","textMapHash":3222129954,"text":"君こそ、今回の行事の責任者よね？変だと思わないの？","nextNodeIds":[110400407]},{"nodeId":110400407,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1008,"speakerName":"バーバラ","textMapHash":648547882,"text":"ど、どこか変かな？","nextNodeIds":[110400408]},{"nodeId":110400408,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"ロサリア","textMapHash":1155731266,"text":"今からモンドに戻っても開始時間に間に合わないわよね。","nextNodeIds":[110400409]},{"nodeId":110400409,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"ロサリア","textMapHash":3427195442,"text":"君をはめるために誰かが仕組んだんじゃないの？","nextNodeIds":[110400410]},{"nodeId":110400410,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1008,"speakerName":"バーバラ","textMapHash":4209722106,"text":"えっ？そ、そんな！みんなはそういうことしないと思う！","nextNodeIds":[110400411]},{"nodeId":110400411,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"ロサリア","textMapHash":2428272362,"text":"それは証拠次第じゃないかしら。それとも君は他人を疑うことを知らないの？","nextNodeIds":[110400412]},{"nodeId":110400412,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"ロサリア","textMapHash":4215451506,"text":"安心して、君がこのまま戻っても誰も怒らないわよ。私が参加すると思ってないでしょうからね。","nextNodeIds":[110400413]},{"nodeId":110400413,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"ロサリア","textMapHash":3379943346,"text":"これ以上モタモタしてると本当に遅刻しちゃうけど。","nextNodeIds":[110400414]},{"nodeId":110400414,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1008,"speakerName":"バーバラ","textMapHash":1274410682,"text":"そうだった！大事な記念行事、遅刻したらまずい…じゃあ、戻るね！","nextNodeIds":[110400415]},{"nodeId":110400415,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3038001842,"text":"なんか…あのシスター、詭弁しか言ってなかった気がするなぁ。","nextNodeIds":[110400416]},{"nodeId":110400416,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"ロサリア","textMapHash":382195394,"text":"さっきから気付いてるわよ——君たち、誰？何のために盗み聞きしてたの？","nextNodeIds":[110400417]},{"nodeId":110400417,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1678435914,"text":"気を付けろ！危険なやつだと思うぞ…少なくとも、ずる賢いのは間違いない。","nextNodeIds":[110400418]},{"nodeId":110400418,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"ロサリア","textMapHash":114852122,"text":"あら？長い歴史を持つ西風教会のメンバーよりも、君のような素性の知れない浮遊物の方が危険だと思うけど。","nextNodeIds":[110400419]},{"nodeId":110400419,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1380468322,"text":"今の聞こえたのか！？すごい小声で言ったのに…","nextNodeIds":[110400420]},{"nodeId":110400420,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"ロサリア","textMapHash":49103338,"text":"ふーん、浮遊物を連れた異邦人…なるほど、君が…ふふっ。","nextNodeIds":[110400421]},{"nodeId":110400421,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"ロサリア","textMapHash":473862530,"text":"風魔龍を倒した「栄誉騎士」、その肩書きに免じて盗み聞きの件は大目に見てあげるわ。","nextNodeIds":[110400422]},{"nodeId":110400422,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"ロサリア","textMapHash":610893522,"text":"でないと…君たちの返答次第では、最悪牢屋に入れる可能性もあるから。","nextNodeIds":[110400423]},{"nodeId":110400423,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3980545722,"text":"えっ！モンドのシスターは不審者の確保も担当してるのか！？","nextNodeIds":[110400424]},{"nodeId":110400424,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"ロサリア","textMapHash":3502023650,"text":"少なくとも見て見ぬふりはできないでしょ？シスターにだって正義感はあるわよ。","nextNodeIds":[110400425]},{"nodeId":110400425,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":723841186,"text":"うっ、なんだか違和感があるけど、否定もできないな…","nextNodeIds":[110400426]},{"nodeId":110400426,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"ロサリア","textMapHash":2111317970,"text":"君たちこそ、何のために雪山に来たの？","nextNodeIds":[110400427,110400428]},{"nodeId":110400427,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":162787362,"text":"アルベドを探しに来た。","nextNodeIds":[110400431]},{"nodeId":110400431,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"ロサリア","textMapHash":1473779610,"text":"彼を探すなら、その足跡を辿ってみるといいわ。","nextNodeIds":[110400432]},{"nodeId":110400432,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"ロサリア","textMapHash":2108812050,"text":"雪が止んでからここを通る人は結構多かったから、まだ残ってるといいんだけど。","nextNodeIds":[110400433]},{"nodeId":110400433,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1730012522,"text":"もしかして、おまえも彼を探しに来たのか？","nextNodeIds":[110400434]},{"nodeId":110400434,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"ロサリア","textMapHash":3121126586,"text":"違うわ、これらの足跡に元素力が残ってたからね。職業病みたいなものよ、警戒しておいて損はないわ。","nextNodeIds":[110400435,110400436]},{"nodeId":110400435,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":948645818,"text":"シスターにしては謎がありすぎる…","nextNodeIds":[110400437]},{"nodeId":110400437,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"ロサリア","textMapHash":469308642,"text":"勝手に思ってなさい。私も彼の様子を見に行くから、行きましょう。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":110400436,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":416101474,"text":"探偵みたいだね。","nextNodeIds":[110400437]},{"nodeId":110400428,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1683932338,"text":"世界の真相を探しに来た。","nextNodeIds":[110400429]},{"nodeId":110400429,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1020,"speakerName":"ロサリア","textMapHash":1344519274,"text":"でも君は旅人、偉大な錬金術師じゃないよね。","nextNodeIds":[110400430]},{"nodeId":11040043